[38.332, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I wrote the marketing plan to `<workspace>/etsy-candle-marketing-plan.md`.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  It has 16 sections:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Foundation:** goals, brand positioning, and target customers (gift buyers, self-care shoppers, seasonal\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  and event buyers).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Etsy-specific work:** an SEO checklist, product and pricing strategy, a seasonal launch calendar,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  photography and video guidance, and how to use Etsy Ads and sales.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Outside Etsy:** a social media plan (Instagram, TikTok, Pinterest), email and retention flows, review\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  tactics, and partnerships.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Execution:** a 90-day action plan, a sample budget of about $110–315 a month, metrics to track, risks,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  and a weekly routine.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The goals, prices and budget figures are starting benchmarks I chose without knowing your shop. The plan has\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  placeholders in brackets for your own numbers. If you tell me your niche, price range, current sales and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  budget, I can tailor it. I can also add a content calendar or draft listing titles and tags.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
