[397.619, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 4/8 · Challenge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Assumptions, riskiest first.** I'll test the ones I can check against real sources, starting with the Etsy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  rules the plan leans on:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  1. The Etsy free-shipping threshold is $35 in the US. The order-value lever rests on this.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  2. The Offsite Ads rules (12% above $10,000, 15% below).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  3. The Etsy Ads minimum budget ($1/day per listing).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  4. Whether the review-request and return-buyer-code tactics follow Etsy's policies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  5. Whether the email signup card follows Etsy's policies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  6. Holiday carrier cutoffs for this year.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  7. Calendar dates.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  8. The 2% conversion, the 1,850 visits, and the November arithmetic.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
