[896.049, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ **Step 5 report (Range)**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Verbs and fields:** Beyond the genre's own verbs (attract, persuade, convert, retain), the plan has to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  decide, deliver, sustain and protect. I borrowed from five fields:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Etsy growth consultant:** one main search phrase per listing, never shared, and a weekly page-1 rank\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  check on five target phrases. The rank check doesn't depend on your small order counts.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Operations / lean manufacturing:** a production calendar. It sets December at about 92 candles (77\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  plus a 20% buffer), with pour-by dates of Nov 16 and Nov 30, Jan 25 and Apr 16. These assume a 14-day cure,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  which is supplier guidance, so test your own wax.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Gift merchandising:** a three-tier price ladder framed by recipient (thank-you, host, mum).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Behaviour-change science:** fixed weekly slots and a minimum viable week (the first row of the week's\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  table plus the scorecard, never more than 2.5 hours).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Red team:** an independent agent read the finished file and the goal, with none of my reasoning.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **The edge I took:** a plan that survives a bad week and never has you sell what you can't make or ship in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **What the red team found, and what I changed:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Margin table:** it used the 15% Offsite Ads rate, but you're probably on the 12% tier. Bundle B ($38)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  also failed my own $12-per-order rule. B is now $39 and the table uses 12%. The Black Friday sale threshold\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  moved to $38+, with a floor of $9 profit per order after the discount.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Creator gifting:** there was no FTC disclosure step and not enough budget. Batches are now 2 sets,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  each with a #gifted card and a burn-safety card. I check each post for the disclosure and repost only with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  written permission. The gifting budget line went from $30 to $40, taken from props and packaging.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Safety and insurance:** this was a single vague line. It is now a Week 1 task covering ASTM F2058\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  label wording, lead-free wicks, fragrance-oil safety data sheets, an insurance quote, a ship test and a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  breakage policy. Health and \"eco\" claims now carry a rule.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Ads:** Week 1 now starts them only if conversion is 1.5% or higher. Week 4 removes a weaker listing\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  instead of shifting budget between listings, which isn't possible. The ad rules can now fire, with a pause\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  point at Week 11.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **December pace:** the even weekly figure understated the real pace, so I added about $751 a week for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Dec 1–14. I also added a stock-cash warning (up to about $830 in materials), email-compliance steps (mailing\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  address and unsubscribe), and a cleaner price-test setup.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Competitor table:** I dropped the feasibility claim and labelled it context only.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Checked:** The arithmetic checker passes, including the production, margin and minimum-viable-week\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  checks. Week 1 had gone to 5.5 hours, and I trimmed it back to 5.0.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Not verified:** I took the agent's findings and checked the plan's numbers myself, but not the agent's\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  citations to the FTC, CAN-SPAM or Etsy policy pages. Those came from secondary sources and need confirming\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  against the official pages. The agent also flagged that I don't know whether the $35 free-shipping rule\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  still affects search today.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
