[914.458, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 6/8 · Judge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **The outside check, defined before I touch the plan again.** It has four parts, none of them me or another\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  model:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  1. **`check_plan.py`** recomputes every number in the file (already built, currently passing).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  2. **A promise checker** that tests each promise in the confirmed restatement against the file, and runs the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  same feature tests on the first version for comparison.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  3. **A render and structure check**, which renders the Markdown to HTML and checks tables, headings, links\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  and leftover placeholders.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  4. **A cold read** of the whole file, as you would read it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The restatement promised a competitor comparison with real figures, and Etsy blocked that. Before I build\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the checker, I'll try the secondhand roundups that sit outside Etsy's block.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
