[1152.76, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 7/8 · Stretch\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **The stretch target.** Your goal is $3,000 a month by April 2027, which is +$1,800 over today. I'm setting\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the stretch at **$6,000 a month in April 2027, with the $3,000 mark reached by the end of February, two\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  months early.** That is +$4,800 over today, about 2.7× the growth you asked for, on the same deadline and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the same limits (5 marketing hours, $150). Your $3,000 goal stays as the fallback, and the existing plan\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  already fits it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  First I'll check whether anyone has done something like this, and what bulk and event orders are worth on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Etsy.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
